      "group": "complex",
      "title": "A log from orbit",
      "summary": "[00:00 - 00:32] Background music features quiet low ambient synthesizer drone with sparse high notes and no percussion. The background ambience contains steady soft ventilation fan hum inside an enclosed cabin. [00:01 - 00:08] An adult male speaker with a low, dry, slightly husky voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"航行日志，第七天。舱内的灯光已经调暗，只有通风系统还在轻轻地响。\" in a low, deliberate delivery. [00:10 - 00:18] An adult male speaker with a low, dry, slightly husky voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"刚才收到家里的留言，母亲说院子里的桂花开了。我听了两遍，舍不得立刻关掉。\" in a restrained, reflective delivery. [00:20 - 00:27] An adult male speaker with a low, dry, slightly husky voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"再过几小时，我们会进入新的轨道。设备一切正常，我也会按时休息，请大家放心。\" in a steady, reassuring delivery. [00:28 - 00:29] A sound effect is heard: one short soft electronic confirmation beep. [00:29 - 00:31] An adult male speaker with a low, dry, slightly husky voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"今天的记录就到这里，晚安。\" in a quiet, concluding delivery.",
