      "id": "long_220",
      "group": "complex",
      "title": "Plans for a rainy weekend",
      "summary": "[00:00 - 00:30] Background music features subdued lo-fi electric piano, soft bass and a slow dry drum beat without vocals. [00:01 - 00:05] An adult male speaker with a low, rounded, smooth voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"周末如果一直下雨，你们还会按原计划出去走走吗？\" in a relaxed, hosting delivery. [00:05 - 00:09] A young adult female speaker with a bright, crisp, light voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"我会带把伞，去河边看看。下雨的时候，人少一点。\" in a bright, casual delivery. [00:09 - 00:13] A middle-aged male speaker with a raspy, chesty, dark voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"我可能先找家小店坐下，等雨小一些，再慢慢出发。\" in a low, unhurried delivery. [00:14 - 00:18] An adult male speaker with a low, rounded, smooth voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"听起来你们都不赶时间。那我们就别安排太满了。\" in a amused, conversational delivery. [00:18 - 00:22] A young adult female speaker with a bright, crisp, light voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"对，走累了就停一停，拍不到照片也没有关系。\" in a cheerful, matter-of-fact delivery. [00:22 - 00:26] A middle-aged male speaker with a raspy, chesty, dark voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"只要鞋子别湿透，我觉得这就算一次不错的出门。\" in a dry, lightly humorous delivery. [00:26 - 00:29] An adult male speaker with a low, rounded, smooth voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"好，就这么定了，记得带伞和干袜子。\" in a friendly, concluding delivery.",
