      "summary": "[00:00 - 00:35] Background music features gentle piano melody over quiet sustained strings, no singing. [00:01 - 00:05] An older male speaker with a low, grainy, rounded voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"明天奶奶过生日，咱们别去饭店了，就在家里吃吧。\" in a warm, unhurried delivery. [00:05 - 00:09] An adult female speaker with a warm, clear, mid-pitched voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"好啊，我来做她爱吃的鱼，你负责把客厅收拾一下。\" in a brisk, friendly delivery. [00:09 - 00:13] A young adult male speaker with a bright, light, slightly breathy voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"那我去买蛋糕。奶奶不喜欢太甜的，我选水果多一点的。\" in a eager, conversational delivery. [00:14 - 00:18] An older male speaker with a low, grainy, rounded voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"蛋糕不用太大，人都到齐了，比准备多少东西都重要。\" in a gentle, reassuring delivery. [00:18 - 00:22] An adult female speaker with a warm, clear, mid-pitched voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"我已经给姐姐打过电话了，她下班以后直接过来。\" in a clear, matter-of-fact delivery. [00:22 - 00:26] A young adult male speaker with a bright, light, slightly breathy voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"我还想把以前的照片找出来，吃完饭让奶奶慢慢看。\" in a bright, thoughtful delivery. [00:27 - 00:31] An older male speaker with a low, grainy, rounded voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"这个主意好，柜子里的相册你拿去，小心别把照片折了。\" in a pleased, gently cautioning delivery. [00:31 - 00:34] An adult female speaker with a warm, clear, mid-pitched voice speaking in Mandarin Chinese says \"那就分头准备，让她明天好好高兴一下。\" in a warm, concluding delivery.",
      "asg": "<scene types=\"music,speech\" dominant=\"speech\" lang=\"zh\">Three Mandarin family members plan a birthday meal over gentle instrumental piano</scene> <source id=\"S1\" kind=\"speaker\" voice=\"older male\" timbre=\"low, grainy, rounded\"/> <source id=\"S2\" kind=\"speaker\" voice=\"adult female\" timbre=\"warm, clear, mid-pitched\"/> <source id=\"S3\" kind=\"speaker\" voice=\"young adult male\" timbre=\"bright, light, slightly breathy\"/> <event id=\"E1\" type=\"music\" time=\"[00:00 - 00:35]\" role=\"background\" extent=\"persistent\">gentle piano melody over quiet sustained strings, no singing</event> <event id=\"E2\" type=\"speech\" time=\"[00:01 - 00:05]\" source=\"S1\" lang=\"zh\" role=\"foreground\" delivery=\"warm, unhurried\">明天奶奶过生日，咱们别去饭店了，就在家里吃吧。</event> <event id=\"E3\" type=\"speech\" time=\"[00:05 - 00:09]\" source=\"S2\" lang=\"zh\" role=\"foreground\" delivery=\"brisk, friendly\">好啊，我来做她爱吃的鱼，你负责把客厅收拾一下。</event> <event id=\"E4\" type=\"speech\" time=\"[00:09 - 00:13]\" source=\"S3\" lang=\"zh\" role=\"foreground\" delivery=\"eager, conversational\">那我去买蛋糕。奶奶不喜欢太甜的，我选水果多一点的。</event> <event id=\"E5\" type=\"speech\" time=\"[00:14 - 00:18]\" source=\"S1\" lang=\"zh\" role=\"foreground\" delivery=\"gentle, reassuring\">蛋糕不用太大，人都到齐了，比准备多少东西都重要。</event> <event id=\"E6\" type=\"speech\" time=\"[00:18 - 00:22]\" source=\"S2\" lang=\"zh\" role=\"foreground\" delivery=\"clear, matter-of-fact\">我已经给姐姐打过电话了，她下班以后直接过来。</event> <event id=\"E7\" type=\"speech\" time=\"[00:22 - 00:26]\" source=\"S3\" lang=\"zh\" role=\"foreground\" delivery=\"bright, thoughtful\">我还想把以前的照片找出来，吃完饭让奶奶慢慢看。</event> <event id=\"E8\" type=\"speech\" time=\"[00:27 - 00:31]\" source=\"S1\" lang=\"zh\" role=\"foreground\" delivery=\"pleased, gently cautioning\">这个主意好，柜子里的相册你拿去，小心别把照片折了。</event> <event id=\"E9\" type=\"speech\" time=\"[00:31 - 00:34]\" source=\"S2\" lang=\"zh\" role=\"foreground\" delivery=\"warm, concluding\">那就分头准备，让她明天好好高兴一下。</event> <mix>E1 background_to E2 | E1 background_to E3 | E1 background_to E4 | E1 background_to E5 | E1 background_to E6 | E1 background_to E7 | E1 background_to E8 | E1 background_to E9</mix>",
